规格:
1.SPC参数监控：所有生产设定参数（速度/压力/温度/电流/真空值/时间/次数/米数/能量/照度/涨缩值/转速/张力/拉力等…）、品质监控参数（PH/电导率/泄漏量/真空度等...）均可以通信显示在人机或PC计算机上；
1.The SPC parameter monitoring: all production parameters (speed / pressure / temperature / current / value / time / frequency / vacuum meters / energy / light / /Aqua/ / value / expansion speed tension force...) The quality monitoring parameters (PH/ conductivity / leakage / vacuum etc.) can all be communicated on man-machine or PC computer ；
a.参数通过可编程逻辑控制器上传信息服务器:由设备商提供寄存器点位/换算比/完成传输；
a.The parameters are uploaded to the information server through 可编程逻辑控制器: the device provider provides the register point / conversion ratio / complete transmission by the device dealer; 
b.参数通过PC上传信息服务器:由设备商提供抛转程序，以web service格式自动上传信息服务器（抛转频率1次/min);
b.The parameters are uploaded to the information server by PC:the device provider provides the tossing program and automatically uploads the information server in the web service format (1 times /min);
